    <section class="trap-tool" id="calculator" aria-labelledby="trap-tool-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="trap-section-head">
          <div>
            <p class="trap-eyebrow">Measure → convert → order</p>
            <h2 id="trap-tool-title">Calculate the layer first, then its weight</h2>
          </div>
          <p>Volume comes from the space you are filling. Tons depend on the particular trap-rock product and its loose bulk weight. Keep those two measurements separate when you call the yard.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="trap-tool-grid">
          <div class="trap-panel trap-inputs">
            <fieldset class="trap-modes">
              <legend>How do you know the area?</legend>
              <label><input type="radio" name="trap-mode" value="dimensions" checked /> Length × width</label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="trap-mode" value="area" /> Total square feet</label>
            </fieldset>
            <div class="trap-fields" id="trap-dimensions-fields">
              <div class="trap-field"><label for="trap-length">Length <span>(ft)</span></label><input id="trap-length" type="number" min="0.01" max="10000" step="any" inputmode="decimal" value="20" /></div>
              <div class="trap-field"><label for="trap-width">Width <span>(ft)</span></label><input id="trap-width" type="number" min="0.01" max="10000" step="any" inputmode="decimal" value="5" /></div>
            </div>
            <div class="trap-fields" id="trap-area-fields" hidden>
              <div class="trap-field"><label for="trap-area">Measured stone area <span>(sq ft)</span></label><input id="trap-area" type="number" min="0.01" max="10000000" step="any" inputmode="decimal" value="100" /></div>
            </div>
            <div class="trap-fields">
              <div class="trap-field"><label for="trap-depth">Finished layer depth <span>(in)</span></label><input id="trap-depth" type="number" min="0.25" max="24" step="any" inputmode="decimal" value="3" /></div>
              <div class="trap-field"><label for="trap-extra">Optional order extra <span>(%)</span></label><input id="trap-extra" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="any" inputmode="decimal" value="0" aria-describedby="trap-extra-help" /></div>
            </div>
            <p class="trap-help" id="trap-extra-help">Use extra only for a measured uneven subgrade, spillage, or another site reason. This is an order allowance, not a fixed “trap rock compaction” rate.</p>
            <div class="trap-divider"></div>
            <div class="trap-field">
              <label for="trap-density">Supplier loose bulk weight <span>(lb/cu yd)</span></label>
